    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs in the terminal that the client opens for a launch. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Sends the process ID of the target through the launch channel, then reads the reply of the adapter. It runs the target only when the reply says that the adapter attached. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
